{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Price is 50% of the normal price, because it is Early Access.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&quot;A Casual, fun, inspiring open-world RPG with dangerous, unique,\u00a0interesting\u00a0 Mythological Monsters, and powerful,\u00a0unbridled,\u00a0innovative magic.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/Pegasus-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter_1_.gif?t=1745685317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Magic in this game is wild...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It has to be because you are fighting against mythical creatures like Minotaurs, Medusa, and the Basilisk, which can paralyze. And deep beneath the dwarf kingdom in the North, there are rumors of something dark waiting to be released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is an open-world, single player RPG game.<br>You can play it casually, taking your time to do quests and explore the world, or you can play it more hard-core. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I like to play open-world RPGs like Skyrim, Oblivion, and Morrowind, as well as Tolkiens universe. So, I have taken the parts I like from them: the wild magic and alchemy from Morrowind, the bright colors from Oblivion, and Skyrim's weapon improvements.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Visit_WolfShire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8ab1d9b80b192bcbc4c9969296bbe16671b255d2.jpg"},{"name":"VisitMossField","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/6cbb0ffd749d6aba9584fe6fe0865ca84eaba61d.jpg"},{"name":"Row Your Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/92639f450cb82409d0c5a64cf9b4ae1bf4c0cb9d.jpg"},{"name":"Just 5 m